<title>GERMANY: Allotment of Telekom shares to investors by region.</title>
<headline>Allotment of Telekom shares to investors by region.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>German telecommunications company Deutsche Telekom AG gave the following breakdown of the allotment of its 20 billion mark share issue by region.</p>
<p>    Germany					 67 percent</p>
<p>    U.S., Canada, South America	     14 percent</p>
<p>    Britain					 8  percent</p>
<p>    Other European countries		  6  percent</p>
<p>    Asia					    5  percent</p>
<p>NOTE- Deutsche Telekom AG also said U.S., Canada and South American investors took 42 percent of the total foreign share in the issue, with British investors taking 24 percent, other European nations 18 percent and Asia 15 percent.</p>
<p>--William Boston, Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
